	(text "NOTE #?: THE MAGNETIC SENSOR OPERATES ON +12V; THIS IS ABOVE THE +5V\nMAXIMUM THAT THE STM PINS CAN HANDLE. THE MOSFET Q8 TAKES THE +12V \nFROM THE SENSOR AND USES IT TO SWITCH A +3.3V DIGITAL SIGNAL THAT CAN\nBE INPUT INTO THE STM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.782 116.586 0)
